            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"scenes\":[{\"index\":0,\"type\":\"tech_startup\",\"durationInFrames\":300,\"narration\":\"在科技的最前沿，我們探索著未來的無限可能。\",\"visualPrompt\":\"A futuristic city skyline at dusk, with glowing buildings and flying drones, showcasing advanced technologies, cinematic lighting, high detail, stable motion, 8k resolution.\",\"cameraMove\":\"慢慢向上移動，展示城市的全景。\",\"transition\":\"淡出\",\"refImageUrl\":\"https://api.kingjam.app/upload/media/1_20260310_100843_155eb0ba.png\"},{\"index\":1,\"type\":\"tech_startup\",\"durationInFrames\":300,\"narration\":\"每一項創新都在改變我們的日常生活。\",\"visualPrompt\":\"A close-up of a group of diverse scientists working on a holographic interface, with intricate data visualizations, cinematic lighting, high detail, stable motion, 8k resolution.\",\"cameraMove\":\"從右向左平移，聚焦在科學家的表情。\",\"transition\":\"淡入\",\"refImageUrl\":\"https://api.kingjam.app/upload/media/1_20260310_100843_155eb0ba.png\"},{\"index\":2,\"type\":\"tech_startup\",\"durationInFrames\":300,\"narration\":\"科技正在重新定義我們的未來。\",\"visualPrompt\":\"A dynamic view of a smart transportation system with autonomous vehicles and pedestrians interacting seamlessly, illuminated by neon lights, cinematic lighting, high detail, stable motion, 8k resolution.\",\"cameraMove\":\"從上向下俯瞰，然後平滑向前移動以展示整個場景。\",\"transition\":\"快速切換\",\"refImageUrl\":\"https://api.kingjam.app/upload/media/1_20260310_100843_155eb0ba.png\"}],\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"model_preference\":\"auto\"}"
