completed\",\"input_params\":{\"project_id\":\"v3_clips\",\"title\":\"場景片段: Introducing Kin...\",\"prompt\":\"A well-designed workspace with a sleek laptop displaying King Jam AI interface, surrounded by motivational posters and a clean desk setup. Cinematic lighting emphasizes the high-tech aesthetics, with smooth interface animations showcasing its features. High detail, stable motion, 8k resolution.\",\"model\":\"Kling/Wan (v3)\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"duration\":\"5\"},\"output_caption\":\"Introducing King Jam AI, your personal super assistant that transforms your workflow.\",\"media_local_path\":null,\"media_cloud_url\":\"https://pub-ce2c051c6f0d48809b2b95a4ef62fbdc.r2.dev/videos/1/2026/03/7657603f_045346.mp4\",\"media_cloud_key\":null,\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"credits_used\":5,\"error_message\":null,\"generation_duration_ms\":null,\"file_size_bytes\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-03-09T04:53:53.763225Z\",\"group_key\":\"video_v3_clips\"},{\"id\":748,\"user_id\":1,\"generation_type\":\"short_video\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"input_params\":{\"project_id\":\"v3_clips\",\"title\":\"場景片段: Let King Jam AI...\",\"prompt\":\"A dynamic view of completed projects displayed on multiple screens, with the AI avatar showing excitement, cinematic lighting, high detail, 8k resolution.\",\"model\":\"Kling/Wan (v3)\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"duration\":\"5\"},\"output_caption\":\"Let King Jam AI elevate your projects to the next level.\",\"media_local_path\":null,\"media_cloud_url\":\"https://pub-ce2c051c6f0d48809b2b95a4ef62fbdc.r2.dev/videos/1/2026/03/0bf807e8_041941.mp4\",\"media_cloud_key\":null,\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"credits_used\":5,\"error_message\":null,\"generation_duration_ms\":null,\"file_size_bytes\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-03-09T04:20:03.079704Z\",\"group_key\":\"video_v3_clips\"},{\"id\":747,\"user_id\":1,\"generation_type\":\"short_video\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"input_params\":{\"project_id\":\"v3_clips\",\"title\":\"場景片段: With powerful f...\",\"prompt\":\"Close-up of the AI avatar interacting with various editing tools, showcasing vibrant graphics and a smooth workflow, cinematic lighting, high detail, 8k resolution.\",\"model\":\"Kling/Wan (v3)\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"duration\":\"5\"},\"output_caption\":\"With powerful features at your fingertips, creativity knows no bounds.\",\"media_local_path\":null,\"media_cloud_url\":\"https://pub-ce2c051c6f0d48809b2b95a4ef62fbdc.r2.dev/videos/1/2026/03/dd2f0161_041955.mp4\",\"media_cloud_key\":null,\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"credits_used\":5,\"error_message\":null,\"generation_duration_ms\":null,\"file_size_bytes\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-03-09T04:20:02.777277Z\",\"group_key\":\"video_v3_clips\"},{\"id\":746,\"user_id\":1,\"generation_type\":\"short_video\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"input_params\":{\"project_id\":\"v3_clips\",\"title\":\"場景片段: Introducing Kin...\",\"prompt\":\"A sleek, futuristic workspace featuring a digital interface with a friendly AI avatar, cinematic lighting, high detail, 8k resolution.\",\"model\":\"Kling/Wan (v3)\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"duration\":\"5\"},\"output_caption\":\"Introducing King Jam AI, your ultimate editing assistant.\",\"media_local_path\":null,\"media_cloud_url\":\"https://pub-ce2c051c6f0d48809b2b95a4ef62fbdc.r2.dev/videos/1/2026/03/4f8622e0_041959.mp4\",\"media_cloud_key\":null,\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"credits_used\":5,\"error_message\":null,\"generation_duration_ms\":null,\"file_size_bytes\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-03-09T04:20:02.463869Z\",\"group_key\":\"video_v3_clips\"},{\"id\":737,\"user_id\":1,\"generation_type\":\"short_video\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"input_params\":{\"project_id\":\"v3_clips\",\"title\":\"場景片段: 讓 King Jam AI 成...\",\"prompt\":\"工作者面帶微笑，與旁邊的 King Jam AI 握手，螢幕上閃爍著效果圖和數據分析，展現合作的愉悅氣氛，cinematic lighting, high detail, stable motion, 8k resolution.\",\"model\":\"Kling/Wan (v3)\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"duration\":\"5\"},\"output_caption\":\"讓 King Jam AI 成為你創作之路上的最佳夥伴。\",\"media_local_path\":null,\"media_cloud_url\":\"https://pub-ce2c051c6f0d48809b2b95a4ef62fbdc.r2.dev/videos/1/2026/03/a23dcbdc_035443.mp4\",\"media_cloud_key\":null,\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"credits_used\":5,\"error_message\":null,\"generation_duration_ms\":null,\"file_size_bytes\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-03-09T03:54:50.594434Z\",\"group_key\":\"video_v3_clips\"},{\"id\":736,\"user_id\":1,\"generation_type\":\"short_video\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"input_params\":{\"project_id\":\"v3_clips\",\"title\":\"場景片段: 無論是文章、圖像或影片，Kin...\",\"prompt\":\"特寫鏡頭對準螢幕，顯示 AI 自動生成的內容，文字與圖片快速切換，展現其高效能，背景仍保持現代化的工作環境，cinematic lighting, high detail, stable motion, 8k resolution.\",\"model\":\"Kling/Wan (v3)\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"duration\":\"5\"},\"output_caption\":\"無論是文章、圖像或影片，King Jam AI 都能快速生成完美內容。\",\"media_local_path\":null,\"media_cloud_url\":\"https://pub-ce2c051c6f0d48809b2b95a4ef62fbdc.r2.dev/videos/1/2026/03/4a664326_035435.mp4\",\"media_cloud_key\":null,\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"credits_used\":5,\"error_message\":null,\"generation_duration_ms\":null,\"file_size_bytes\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-03-09T03:54:50.248552Z\",\"group_key\":\"video_v3_clips\"},{\"id\":735,\"user_id\":1,\"generation_type\":\"short_video\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"input_params\":{\"project_id\":\"v3_clips\",\"title\":\"場景片段: 在這個科技驅動的時代，King...\",\"prompt\":\"一個高科技的工作空間，桌上擺放著筆記本電腦，螢幕上顯示著 King Jam AI 的界面，工作者正專心地編輯內容，背景有柔和的光線和現代家具，cinematic lighting, high detail, stable motion, 8k resolution.\",\"model\":\"Kling/Wan (v3)\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"duration\":\"5\"},\"output_caption\":\"在這個科技驅動的時代，King Jam AI 讓內容創作變得更加輕鬆。\",\"media_local_path\":null,\"media_cloud_url\":\"https://pub-ce2c051c6f0d48809b2b95a4ef62fbdc.r2.dev/videos/1/2026/03/599c840e_035419.mp4\",\"media_cloud_key\":null,\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"credits_used\":5,\"error_message\":null,\"generation_duration_ms\":null,\"file_size_bytes\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-03-09T03:54:49.883381Z\",\"group_key\":\"video_v3_clips\"},{\"id\":692,\"user_i